# A view no imported file covers (far from the fixture's tiles), at the fixture's deepest level (15): "No map here".
# Zoomed out to 14 it stays: the engine's record of a converted folder now holds the extent of every level, so the
# shallower levels are bounded too and the plate follows the engine (before the pin 28817a5 it went at 14).
title No map here
sizes 640x480 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 45.75,4.85,15

wait 1000
shot no-map-here
expect text "No map here"
key pgdn
wait 800
expect text "No map here"
key esc
expect quit
